  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5602.02 Form and Payment Required. Any authorized person requesting motor vehicle record information shall submit the appropriate form and payment prior to the department’s release of information.\n\nSource. #6403, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-97; rpld and ss by #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
